{"symbol":"JAYANT","yahoo":"JAYANT.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Jayant Infratech Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Railroads","website":"https://www.jayantinfra.com","about":"Jayant Infratech Limited operates in the railway infrastructure development in India. The company is involved in the design, erection, supply, and commissioning of 25KV, 50Hz single phase traction overhead equipment for use in the electrification of new and existing railway lines. It also engages in the provision of overhead electrification work, traction sub-station, sub-sectioning work, railway siding, switching and feeding post work, and modification of OHE work; installation of signaling and telecom systems for safety and coordination; electrical general work; and track laying, strengthening, and alignment for rail operations, as well as Maintenance of OHE and PSI Work. The company serves Indian Railways, and other public and private sectors clients. Jayant Infratech Limited was incorporated in 2003 and is headquartered in Bilaspur, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:32:15+00:00","quote":{"price":75.45,"prevClose":72.0,"marketCap":77.99,"high52":110.74,"low52":43.97,"pe":9.28,"bookValue":57.8,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":15.41,"shares":1.0337,"insiders":62.66,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2022-07-13","2022-07-14","2022-07-15","2022-07-18","2022-07-19","2022-07-20","2022-07-21","2022-07-22","2022-07-25","2022-07-26","2022-07-27","2022-07-28","2022-07-29","2022-08-01","2022-08-02","2022-08-03","2022-08-04","2022-08-05","2022-08-08","2022-08-10","2022-08-11","2022-08-12","2022-08-16","2022-08-17","2022-08-18","2022-08-19","2022-08-22","2022-08-23","2022-08-24","2022-08-25","2022-08-26","2022-08-29","2022-08-30","2022-09-01","2022-09-02","2022-09-05","2022-09-06","2022-09-07","2022-09-08","2022-09-09","2022-09-12","2022-09-13","2022-09-14","2022-09-15","2022-09-16","2022-09-19","2022-09-20","2022-09-21","2022-09-22","2022-09-23","2022-09-26","2022-09-27","2022-09-28","2022-0